      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T09:47:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But git verify-tag should return a failure error code if there are no known principals?[1] So maybe JGit does it right.\n\n[1] https://github.com/git/git/blob/e4ef0485fd78fcb05866ea78df35796b904e4a8e/gpg-interface.c#L534",
      "parentUuid": "733cd53d_5ff04ad8",
      "revId": "e920039b4093da17efdc10ea8c1d9b52ef24ba2d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
